        "file": "README.md",
        "line": "- io_uring issuers use multishot direct accept/receive, fixed socket descriptors, provided buffers and batched completions. Tables adapt to the inherited hard limit: eight rings of 65,535 slots under the spec limit, or one ring of 524,280 slots with a one-million limit. Accepted sockets occupy those tables instead of ordinary process descriptors, lifting the previous connection ceiling under LimitNOFILE=65535. The process raises only its own soft limit within the inherited hard limit."
